{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "727dfc27-71aa-8cd5-8020-0d1622a8585e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T10:27:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I just bought a house, closed on it a couple weeks ago, and the first water and sewer bill came and it's in the name of the man who sold it to me. Not mine at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that happens a lot right after a sale. The account sometimes stays under the old owner's name until the transfer gets processed. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "113 Ruggles Avenue. Up on the Hill. And I'm Sheila Doyle, D-O-Y-L-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Ms. Doyle. Let me pull that up. [pause] Yep, I see the account, and you're right, it's still showing the previous owner. The bill itself is for the property, so the balance goes with the house, but we can get your name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a hassle. I didn't think I'd have to chase it. I figured the closing people would've handled, you know, all that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes they send the notice and it takes a while to get to us. I'll note your name and the sale on the account now. Do you want me to update the mailing address too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Same address, the house. But I'd like a copy of this bill sent by email, a duplicate, so I have it. The paper one is, um, kind of confusing with his name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can do that. What email would you like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd rather not say it out loud on the phone, honestly. Can you read back what I give you? It's, hold on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, take your time. I'll type it in and read it back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's the shop address, sheila at, well, I'll spell it. [pause] Did you get all that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did. I'll read it back so we're sure it's right. Okay, that matches what you said? Good. You should have the duplicate within the hour or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Now, how do I pay it? I run a shop, I'm there all day, and City Hall hours just don't work for me. I only get a lunch break around noon. Can I pay online from work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can. There's an online payment page on the city website, and you'll need the account number from the bill. That works any time, day or night, so your lunch break is fine. There's also a drop box at City Hall if you'd rather pay by check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The online will do. I don't have time to be driving over there with a check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If the page doesn't take the name, just use the account number and it'll go through. Once we update the owner it'll show yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, okay. You know, you remind me of a nurse I knew once, a kind one. Same way of explaining things so they make sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's nice of you to say. I'll take it. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you, Tony. Just wish this had been simpler."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:27:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Have a good holiday week, Ms. Doyle."
    }
  ],
